### Core Review Assessment

1. **Six Model Options and Consent Behavior:**
   - All six model choices remain defined in [`_MODELS`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L94-L97) and mapped to official HF repositories in [`_MODEL_REPOSITORIES`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L148-L155).
   - In [`_prepare_model_snapshot`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L243-L261), unconsented execution (`consent_given=False`) on a missing or incomplete cache snapshot raises an explicit `PermissionError`.
2. **Cache Resolution and Asset Acquisition:**
   - [`is_model_downloaded`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L221-L228) and [`_cached_model_snapshot`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L201-L219) perform read-only filesystem validation without directory creation or network calls.
   - In [`transcribe_audio`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L382-L490), the resolved snapshot directory path is passed with `local_files_only=True`, selecting faster-whisper's existing local directory branch (`os.path.isdir`) without invoking remote downloads.
3. **Companion Delta (Local Tokenizer Preparation & Non-local Fallback):**
   - In [companion-B.patch.txt](file:///E:/AI/projects/uoink/checkouts/Yoink-library/_scratch/companion-b-static-qualification01/original-proposal01/companion-B.patch.txt), available tokenizers are parsed before CTranslate2 model allocation.
   - When `local_files_only=True` and no local tokenizer exists, it raises `FileNotFoundError` before model construction.
   - When `local_files_only=False` and the local file is absent, `prepared_tokenizer` remains `None`, preserving the downstream multilingual-aware fallback `tokenizers.Tokenizer.from_pretrained(...)`.

---

### Three Actionable Findings

1. **Supplied Empty Tokenizer Buffer Bypasses Buffer Parsing:**
   - *Call sequence:* `WhisperModel(model_path, files={"tokenizer.json": b""}, local_files_only=True)`
   - *Consequence:* `if tokenizer_bytes:` evaluates `b""` as `False`, falling through to disk checking. If an ambient disk file exists, it loads disk data instead of the buffer; if absent, it raises a misleading `FileNotFoundError` claiming the local file is missing.
   - *Affected lines:* [companion-B.py.txt](file:///E:/AI/projects/uoink/checkouts/Yoink-library/_scratch/companion-b-static-qualification01/original-proposal01/companion-B.py.txt#L691-L696) lines 691–696.
   - *Smallest repair:* Replace `if tokenizer_bytes:` with `if tokenizer_bytes is not None:`.
2. **Snapshot Identity Comparison on Windows:**
   - *Call sequence:* `_prepare_model_snapshot` receives a download path from Hugging Face Hub and checks it with [`_checked_model_snapshot`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L179-L199).
   - *Consequence:* Line 187 checks `snapshot.resolve(strict=True) != snapshot`. On Windows, `snapshot = Path(snapshot).absolute()` retains input path casing (e.g. lowercase drive letter), while `resolve(strict=True)` normalizes casing to uppercase. This discrepancy evaluates to `True`, returning `None` and spuriously raising `RuntimeError` on valid downloads.
   - *Affected lines:* [whisper_runner.py](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L184-L188) lines 184 and 187.
   - *Smallest repair:* Normalize `snapshot = Path(snapshot).resolve(strict=True)` before checking parent and ensuring `not snapshot.is_symlink()`.
3. **Local-Only Guarantee Relies on Unapplied Companion B:**
   - *Call sequence:* In current runtime with unpatched faster-whisper, a filesystem race deletes `tokenizer.json` after [`_checked_model_snapshot`](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L179-L199).
   - *Consequence:* Unpatched `faster_whisper.WhisperModel.__init__` constructs CTranslate2, misses the tokenizer, and calls `from_pretrained(...)` without `local_files_only`, breaching offline isolation.
   - *Affected lines:* [whisper_runner.py](file:///C:/Users/hello/AppData/Local/AgentControlRoom/worktrees/uoink-library/131e52c7-b6e/gemini/whisper_runner.py#L433-L436) lines 433–436 vs unpatched `faster_whisper/transcribe.py` lines 700–708.
   - *Smallest repair:* Qualify and apply Companion B to the staged faster-whisper dependency.

